<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.14.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.14.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.14.0 (2026-11-24): Chapter 11 deck story done. Deck 4.0.0 holds each of the 19 codes whole in one box, taken from the single source, with one explanation balloon and one result visual per slide; 41 slides as before."""@en .

ex:TK11_Deck_11_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "03-materials/ch11/SEN0414_Ch11_OrganizingFiles_3e_v4_0_0.pptx built by 08-tooling/chapter_deck_build_v2_7_0.py from 08-tooling/ch11-deck/spec_v4_0_0 and source 03-materials/ch11/source/ch11_code_source_v1_1_0.json; manifest 03-materials/ch11/page/chapter_code_ch11_v1_2_0.json. 41 slides (no slide added). Old deck 3.0.0 stays unchanged. Slides 13, 20, 26 and 34 were viewed after rendering; two repairs came from the checks (rmtree result was chips only; a wrapped ZIP call had a 22-space hanging indent, now a four-space indent) and the code frame height now grows with its line count." .
ex:TK11_Deck_11_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch11-deck/logs_v4_0_0: code_check (C1 list equals source, C2 one whole code box equal to source, C4 set-up plus code runs: 19 examples, 0 findings); deck_standard_v1_2_0 (13 of 13 PASS; v1.2.0 is a new file that exempts boxes named code from the 30-word limit because a code box is not prose; v1.1.0 stays); overlap, reader_notes, story_prose, fit, layout, notes all clean. The builder's older manifest_selfcheck 2.1.0 runs bare code without the hidden set-up lines, so it reports findings that do not apply to deck 4.0.0; its log is kept and the set-up-aware run is the code check C4 and the page step. The old teaching check 1.0.0 (40 to 60 word notes, reads balloons as code) predates the 2026-11-14 rulings and was not used. C3 (page holds the whole code) waits for the page story." .
ex:ST11_Deck_11 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Criterion met: every code of chapter 11 is whole in one box on its slide, equal to the source, with the result drawn from the run. Slide and page equality (C3) is measured in ST11_Page_11."  .
